     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_rava_ketilei_kedar",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "והא רבא הוא דאמר נפישי קטילי קדר מנפיחי כפן? -- but Rava himself is the one who said more are killed by the pot than swollen by hunger! (kind svara under protest: an amoraic-memra contradiction)",
     "against": "p_rava_chash",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_shani_rava",
     "gloss_en": "שאני רבא, דאנסי ליה רבנן בעידניה בעל כורחיה -- Rava is different: the Rabbis compelled him at his time against his will (= p_shani_rava)",
     "answers": "obj_rava_ketilei_kedar",
     "restores": "p_rava_chash"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_shmuel_hakatan_mi_mefis",
     "gloss_en": "Shmuel HaKatan fell ill with it; he said: Master of the world, who will cast the lot? -- he was healed"
    }
   ]
